    {
      "id": "claim_6adb720043cf488daffaf63cb3198f23",
      "statement": "check_reward.py maps a Harbor job to three CI outcomes by exit code: 0 pass, 1 eval failed (a reward was not 1.0, meaning the filter changed behavior), 2 infrastructure error (errored/cancelled/incomplete trials or missing result.json); Harbor itself always exits 0 regardless of pass/fail.",
